# NPC simulation tier parity (docs/world-streaming.md, step 1, item 6): one continuous game day from a
# fresh NEWWORLD (day 0, 08:00), every NPC journalled every 5 game minutes (npc-day*.csv).
# No `set time`: it teleports everyone to their routine point. Run it in two modes and compare:
#   WORLD=NEWWORLD.ZEN OPENGOTHIC_NPC_SIM_TIER=full TIMEOUT=7200 RYZEN_MAX=110m BENCH_HOST=ryzen \
#     scripts/bench.sh npc-day-parity /absolute/out/full-1
#   scripts/npc_day_parity.py /absolute/out/full-1 /absolute/out/simplified-1 \
#     --tolerances scripts/bench/npc-day-parity.tolerances.json --out report.md
# The hero stands, immortal, on open ground in the valley below Xardas' tower.
seed 73106
cheat god
world-check NEWWORLD.ZEN
goto NW_XARDAS_TOWER_VALLEY_091
npcday 1440 5
